      Part3: 3998822308
      Part4: 4248372191
    tag: 
  allNodes:
  - dialogueText: 'How the... *sigh* I knew the code was too easy to guess.

      Oh,
      well, at least it wasn''t <b>him</b> who figured it out.

      So what''s
      your deal? Are you a reporter? A spy? An officer? What should I do with you?'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 767062219271962644
    - rid: 3046478613006778468
    - rid: 3046479065253413046
    isRootNode: 1
    editorPosition: {x: -67.000015, y: 205.40004}
    altDialoguePaths:
    - rid: 3046479065253413052
    - rid: 3046479065253413058
    guid:
      Part1: 2765584323
      Part2: 1327550847
      Part3: 1666019492
      Part4: 233340015
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'So he trusts you, then. And yet he felt like he had no reason
      to tell me about you.

      Seriously, why do i seem to be the only one who
      knows how to do my job properly?

      Ok, so then you must have come here
      looking for something. Be quick.'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778473
    - rid: 3046478613006778474
    - rid: 3046478613006778475
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1168.0001, y: -344.10843}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1318923701
      Part2: 1171942027
      Part3: 1249581199
      Part4: 2220878921
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Well, you''re the first and only person to come into this room,
      and the door to "the place" is still closed, so nothing''s gone wrong so far.

      Though,
      of course, I didn''t account on you being a part of this so, please don''t
      get in the way.

      This is a very serious business for me, alright?'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778477
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2239, y: -573.1084}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1793333401
      Part2: 1171380598
      Part3: 3820204718
      Part4: 2833258252
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Then do me a favour and remind him that I said MANY TIMES that
      I would be the one taking care of that.

      And make sure that he keeps
      in mind that he''s in debt with me, and that he''s still <b>alive</b> for a
      reason.'
    characterEmotion: 3
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778479
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2239, y: -284.10843}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1683037540
      Part2: 1260846199
      Part3: 2890197385
      Part4: 3089921095
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '...Please tell me you''re joking. There must have been a good
      reason for Oleg to let you in, and clearly your intelligence is not it.

      Look,
      just... stay out of this, alright? Clearly you''re not very well prepared,
      and you could easily get caught in the crossfire, so it''s better if you don''t
      get involved.'
    characterEmotion: 2
    characterReaction: 0
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778478
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2213, y: -13.108383}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 3955440315
      Part2: 1117530599
      Part3: 2347906988
      Part4: 2760803032
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'No shit. And he sent you, a complete stranger, all the way here
      to find the code and tell me that?

      The kid''s ability to either be the
      biggest idiot or the most accidental genius will never cease to surprise me.

      Listen,
      I don''t know who you are, and luckily, you seem to be confused, so it''s probably
      best if you stay out of this.

      And don''t tell him about the code. He...
      didn''t earn it, let''s say.'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046478613006778470
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1100.7, y: 309.81955}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1236868376
      Part2: 1118450809
      Part3: 2601666998
      Part4: 2003653583
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '...heh... yeah, you could say that. You see, we''ve done a lot
      of... "work" together and, while he was never too bright, I managed to... train
      him well.

      Thing is, I have... fallen out of love with the work I do,
      and with our... "boss"... but, see, that''s not something I can tell him without...
      hurting him.

      Luckily, if things go right, this should be the last time
      we work together. I''m looking forward to... "retirement".'
    characterEmotion: 4
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253413042
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 2279.7, y: 422.81958}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2323406998
      Part2: 1218302688
      Part3: 831922608
      Part4: 2915300154
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: '...in a way, yes. Which is why you should probably not get too
      involved in this.

      I''m here to complete a task, my last task... and
      I''m no longer going to doubt if I have to... change my "objectives".'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 6
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253413044
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3749, y: 577.5}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 1619960445
      Part2: 1120043846
      Part3: 3301554071
      Part4: 3045703875
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'What else, then? The world''s best guesser? A time traveler? A
      detective with a magical notebook?

      I have no time for jokes, much less
      for you. I''ll pretend you didn''t just intrude, for you own safety, so <b>leave</b>.'
    characterEmotion: 3
    characterReaction: 7
    doesItProveAnything: 0
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253413049
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 1116, y: 584}
    altDialoguePaths: []
    guid:
      Part1: 2167883634
      Part2: 1077765070
      Part3: 2226348957
      Part4: 3784299256
    tag: 
  - dialogueText: 'Which is why you should stay away. We can''t afford to have people
      going around asking questions like that.

      Need I remind you that the
      whole reason why this works is the fact the <b>he</b> doesn''t know?

      I''m
      not going to risk it... I don''t want to keep working for them. This is my
      way out, so please, step aside.'
    characterEmotion: 1
    characterReaction: 2
    doesItProveAnything: 4
    isKey: 0
    responses:
    - rid: 3046479065253413174
    isRootNode: 0
    editorPosition: {x: 3684.2007, y: 29.00001}
    altDialoguePaths: []
