    - rid: 3046479097160532007
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: '...getting into my room, I''m afraid.

          The thing
          is this "game" was mostly just a way to punish me for taking so long to
          arrive.

          He got to set the code of the room before I got here,
          and now he''s asking me to figure it out for myself.

          Which is
          why I''m asking for help, if you don''t mind.'
        characterEmotion: 2
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
